From 50e15dee411b93ec3eb6ea0d91cba87e1bff6ab2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:11:23 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Dialer Home (favorites row over the call log) and
 Recordings tab

Home is the first tab and the default: a row of starred contacts above the call log. The old Favorites slot is Recordings, which
lists the call recorder's MediaStore files (Recordings/CallRecordings) with play/pause, share and delete. Tab order Home,
Recordings, Contacts, Voicemail; the last-tab preference has a new key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
